BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm 14 TL /F2 9.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Explanation:) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( Development implements the planned system. The project source uses FastAPI routes such as) Tj T* (/generate-home, /generate-party, /generate-jewelry, /register, /login, /logout, /token, /session-info, /session-data,) Tj T* (/recommendations-details, and /history. The backend communicates with the Gemini recommendation layer and the) Tj T* (frontend renders results.) Tj T* ET
